{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7b9587706cf3696343087cc12a97e2ff7bb9334cd1070248cf6801b8e17fa553", "ja": "（新たなアイドルを求め、彷徨い続ける中……。\n今日は、自衛隊基地のお祭りに足を延ばした）", "zh": "（为了寻找新的偶像，我四处徘徊……\n而今天，我来到自卫队基地举办的庆典。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "015421f0980fcfec322a7e0512ff1c9dbd2824dc1297913a46018f52c41bd205", "ja": "（音楽隊と共演するボーカリストが評判だと聞いて、\n見に来たんだけど……困ったな、入り口がわからない）", "zh": "（听说与乐队同台的歌手大受好评，\n所以才过来看看……但真伤脑筋，我找不到入口。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "69b4d7bcc1ce3603e33ec06c0df3d6f6e883fe7a4413ced3069b2e0b1819ad91", "ja": "どうなさいました？\nもしかして……見学の方ですか？", "zh": "请问有什么事情吗？\n您是不是……来参观的来宾呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "519700fbc1c05c1053032bfa9752e7ea5d27412e9509a1d20f9d40e3497f03f3", "ja": "えっ？　あ、そうなんです。\nコンサートを見に来たんですけど……。", "zh": "咦？啊，是的。\n我是来听音乐会的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "a409974ef3aba04298d9f0d057291e21a4334c95c9798e5cf8265dd3de80a3d7", "ja": "ふふっ。こう敷地が広いと、迷ってしまいますよね。\n私も今から向かうところなので、ご案内します。", "zh": "呵呵，基地幅员广阔，很容易迷路呢。\n我也正好要过去会场，顺道帮您带路吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2a9cbed4d3f7e3edbef43562f1fea90cd5ad0a23b87a217e44e1f8e719d7a9e1", "ja": "ありがとうございます、助かります！", "zh": "感激不尽，得救了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4baaacf581651aafc1320507dba46606bedeefa96300abea04830e6611a6c4eb", "ja": "（綺麗な声の人だな。それに、線が細くて柔らかい印象\n……とても自衛官とは思えないけど、もしかして）", "zh": "（她的声音真悦耳。而且散发出纤细、柔和的气质……\n感觉实在不像是自卫官，该不会──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9af4dbb064c67e862e33bba3e0ead045cfef7aa62548d2f7eadaea3c87bb07c1", "ja": "失礼ですが、あなたも自衛隊の方なんですか？", "zh": "不好意思，请问你也是自卫队的人员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "221bb251fd2e1e7586d183b0733d6f71ae14ea0d959bf7755620a52d68cc55c7", "ja": "いいえ。私ではなく、父が自衛官で……。\n今日は、コンサートのお手伝いに来ただけなんです。", "zh": "不是的。我并不是，但我父亲是自卫官……\n今天我只是来协助举办音乐会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3c031054998d9f1c8a808199540326ae378716a80fc6332784101902e35dccd", "ja": "と言っても、ただステージで歌うだけなので……\n遊びに来たようなものですけど。ふふっ♪", "zh": "话是这么说，其实只是上台唱唱歌……\n还比较像是跟着来玩的，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8b6cc379cc3ba2c9c816d83dab9894371c75b9c6dff27e046c37218549f6c5ba", "ja": "やっぱり……！", "zh": "果然是这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_1012", "source_sha256": "b17ca4d3bdeeeaffbc5d36b1c3d7e7fd69390b707c28e7d3c021eca0bf941d3d", "ja": "名刺を渡す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9f682f513994bec04e2c9d60d52408dd2430d89d173406d93efb608fb88de825", "ja": "俺は今日、あなたに会うためにここに来ました。\nこういう者なんですが……。", "zh": "我今天就是来见你的。\n这是我的名片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2001_052kao", "source_sha256": "1e070f6a4d714ed315e70fd52614fa106a2ce5f452fadde2f8c374cc7f5404b1", "ja": "まあ！　アイドルの、プロデューサーさん……？\nすごい方なんですね。", "zh": "哇！原来您是偶像的制作人吗……？\n好厉害呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2002_052kao", "source_sha256": "a2a5606c9a755a70395a4d93735253c16188f365ce688cf8ff5e860afe91b983", "ja": "あっ……私ったら、名刺を頂いたのに名乗りもせず……\n失礼しました。桜守歌織と申します。", "zh": "啊……我真是失礼，收到名片却没报上自已名字……\n真不好意思。我叫做樱守歌织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2003_052kao", "source_sha256": "0510895c116e5ca71bd536e74f28db320a072275f67abdb960211b02e0475d63", "ja": "それで、私に……ご用ですか？\nあの、いったい、どういう……？", "zh": "那么，您找我……有何贵干呢？\n请问，这究竟是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "548b85546750016d6d15720cedcee045f3f8cdae0b9090d7f051c4ec89c41a61", "ja": "はい、桜守歌織さん。\n39プロジェクトのアイドルになりませんか？", "zh": "是这样的，樱守歌织小姐。\n请问你愿不愿意成为39PROJECT的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2005_052kao", "source_sha256": "defd42358bb72c2f979ffb766bcddf7d1e48cc7c78485417661ad27ea698f42c", "ja": "えっ？　アイドルって、あの……、\nアイドルですか？　私が？", "zh": "什么？成为偶像？请问……\n是那个偶像吗？我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "564a8d4acffc73383fe5ad973001f1eec22ba029e3c073808132161b1d4263f1", "ja": "はい。あなたには、人を惹きつけるものがあります。\nアイドルの素質があると思います！", "zh": "是的，你身上有很吸引人的特点，\n我认为你有成为偶像的潜力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e63f977a912150a78a09a79eee3060ccab236d8e0a4137aac01428028f662337", "ja": "それに何と言ってもボーカリストとしての実力は、\n自衛隊の折り紙付きですし。", "zh": "更重要是你的歌唱实力，\n那可是自卫队挂保证的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2008_052kao", "source_sha256": "09404d231c94e65f3e493fcd406306de7155bee58cb85fefe53d28c50d77331b", "ja": "実力だなんて、そんな……。私はただ父のツテで、\n自衛隊の方と共演させていただいているだけなんです。", "zh": "我哪有什么实力，您过奖了……我只是靠着父亲的关系，\n才得以和自卫队同台演出罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "0fd59badf8bf526af2462aa5ff6a9867a01d1f1ce0536da3dd73ff57eb58a5f3", "ja": "たとえ身内だったとしても……\nいや、そういう問題じゃないか。", "zh": "即便是靠关系上台的……\n不，问题应该不在那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "bdbe399d192115394937c89c785c468350d782abfc060b564afa0a6a590f059d", "ja": "歌織さん、俺はプロデューサーとして、貴方に惹きつ\nけられました。正直、他の理由はどうでもいいです。", "zh": "歌织小姐，我身为一个制作人，深深受到你的吸引。\n老实说，其他理由根本就无所谓了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "041d6873f5ef1c86954017e8a1d872fdedf75c6cb073b50bf1188a41a8d0b12f", "ja": "俺に貴方を、アイドルとして……\nプロデュースさせてください！", "zh": "请你成为偶像……\n让我来培育吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2012_052kao", "source_sha256": "f4f31b7909a68fcff5362bcb11141b8677d3ee9a705dfbcde6dfb1b800c0c88a", "ja": "あ、あの……、でも……。", "zh": "不、不好意思……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2013_052kao", "source_sha256": "517954dc3a9fa2bb81caffb18d09c0b6f495efc22bcf4192f347a910fa160d44", "ja": "子供っぽく見えるかもしれませんけれど……\n私、もう成人している大人……なんですよ？", "zh": "我的外表看起来或许有点稚气……\n但其实我已经是成年人了……您知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2014_052kao", "source_sha256": "138ca1280c3fcaef9ed1e70f5ee87a80a27af42a416980a81280da8e1a91902f", "ja": "だから、今からアイドルと言うのは、その……。\nよろしいんですか……？", "zh": "所以，年纪这么大了还要当偶像，这样……\n真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "4cba14f0a57120845b981a594ad169b89403360efcb1609753edc86f62fed035", "ja": "よろしいです！　全然問題ありません。\nむしろ、あなた以上の人を探すのは難しいと思います。", "zh": "当然可以！完全没问题。\n我甚至认为很难找到比你更适合的人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2016_052kao", "source_sha256": "f8c0e0ee927f18fe464780c422c5ec8baee51c452234ac3faf7951161e4abcc3", "ja": "もう……お上手ですね！\nもしかして、私をからかわれてらっしゃるとか？", "zh": "真是的……您还真会说话！\n该不会其实是在寻我开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2017_p", "source_sha256": "c2108eda1d265aedb23f3cf66f74429ae23c5e12d26a0ba752375cdbb2e08958", "ja": "そんな風に見えたのなら謝ります。\nでも俺は、本気も本気です！", "zh": "如果让你误会了，我道歉。\n不过我是真的很认真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2018_052kao", "source_sha256": "995b807d039c67f0d9d47505627463fc6a9895ea7a76f9829a6cff41261468d6", "ja": "いえ……ごめんなさい。つい、逃げてしまって。\n伝わってきますから。貴方が本気なこと……。", "zh": "不……是我该道歉，我下意识地逃避了。\n我都感受到了，您是如此认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2019_052kao", "source_sha256": "899c561fd9bc2051999417ca8ea71a9fa2878b61e13e0e50c2b285879cb85330", "ja": "アイドル……。\nなれるのかしら、私……。", "zh": "偶像……\n我真的当得了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_2020", "source_sha256": "4e92d77ff5b9c3f7bd8ebbfefa906881d01f7ad5c0cd0d1c5f55414d3fae4307", "ja": "してみせます", "zh": "我会让你当上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3000_p", "source_sha256": "8087d9035f1d6d232fa0b67f833a39f66030575de47019a57c6c35b5c39d62d4", "ja": "必ずしてみせます。\nそれが俺の……プロデューサーの仕事ですから。", "zh": "我一定会让你当上偶像。\n这就是我的……也就是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3001_052kao", "source_sha256": "b0d6433f8e935087c17d47c5273fcf8ade42f8c2c95c6a872d881256deefd358", "ja": "そ……、そうですか……。", "zh": "是……是这样子吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3002_p", "source_sha256": "5665f665978b967f294f574f93db69e1b2d11e94c960e576387ad846d91182a6", "ja": "もちろん、歌織さんさえよければ、ですけど。\n俺に貴方を、プロデュースさせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "当然，那也要先有歌织小姐同意才行。\n请问可以让我培育你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3003_052kao", "source_sha256": "f894573e5dd2533607dd566f168851d2fec1863f615d2e83deccc5f5bb1a7eee", "ja": "あの……。考えさせていただいても、いいですか？\n家族とも相談して……。", "zh": "不好意思……可以给我一些时间考虑吗？\n我想和家人商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3004_052kao", "source_sha256": "e94fafe117ab51c27a96e973f967ca3f5606ac0814748b078a2fb4a3a8909191", "ja": "あっ……いいえ、違いますね。私、もう大人ですもの。\nさっき自分で言ったばかり……。", "zh": "啊……不行，这样子不对，我已经是成年人了。\n明明自己才刚讲过的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3005_052kao", "source_sha256": "34b0ce4e564380e3e560ed009f0d8636ed6fb35f50c3cfff8be3f7f6688ff806", "ja": "考えさせてください。あなたのお申し出……。\nこの胸の中で、しっかりと。", "zh": "请让我慎重考虑一下您的提议吧……\n我会在自己心里深思熟虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3006_p", "source_sha256": "6151d8941873ab03982440569bec8799825f3c60f3daafe6e2be11b0e437f1b6", "ja": "ええ。待ってます！", "zh": "好的，静候佳音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3008_052kao", "source_sha256": "3acbaa656ccbc11c4613824b6a729db2209b2b65734cc2164a5759a45c759f4c", "ja": "失礼します。\nこちらに、{$P$}さんは……。", "zh": "打扰了。\n我听说{$P$}先生在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3009_p", "source_sha256": "22cf0d4659eae5509498c2c9b9be7f2ada34f84c7239614efe2bc4dddefe7cb4", "ja": "あっ……歌織さん！？", "zh": "啊……歌织小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3010_052kao", "source_sha256": "7adc44fad8c36b0c53c75deb64bd4b235fac07afa5da5a0b7d16ceb9152da526", "ja": "あの……私……。\nあれから、ひとりでよく考えて……決心しました。", "zh": "那个……我……\n在那之后一个人认真考虑……并且下定决心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3011_052kao", "source_sha256": "bf024eaf2a0aa08e740c107be16286116ca186caa3d6672ca4ba663608299582", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私を……アイドルにしてくださいますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n可以让我……成为偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3012_p", "source_sha256": "ce9e94e75886b2ed1b15988091044b8962b25800d4f4fe72d0635dc53f441d60", "ja": "はい！　もちろんです！", "zh": "好！当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3013_052kao", "source_sha256": "d5df3fce41490c4c3e30ef8261fee318da11def0b45abc17b7665d03de8c5ee6", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます！　貴方のその言葉に、\n私……一歩を踏み出す勇気をいただきました。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你！你那时所说的话，\n给予我……迈出脚步的勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3014_052kao", "source_sha256": "4d43cdfcdc5c5de7c25c0b9df2de599cff11e44c74d2a265b14a5cce9814064e", "ja": "今、すごくドキドキしています。\n私はこれから、どうなってしまうのかしら……って。", "zh": "现在我的心脏跳得好快。\n不知道自己以后会变成什么样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_052kao_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_052kao_001_3015_052kao", "source_sha256": "e40e3336f79a940c3b3a9c6a3fc601e6369c29437964e2cf3b237b41a8b2d1dd", "ja": "私をこんな風にした責任……取ってくださいね？\nどうか、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "让我变成这样……请你一定要负起责任哦。\n以后还请多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
